		"name": "CareerForge API v3 (Complete)",
		"description": "# CareerForge API v3 - Complete Collection\n\nOfficial API collection for the CareerForge Backend. This API provides comprehensive capabilities for CV management, AI-powered parsing, intelligent optimization, ATS analysis, and PDF generation.\n\n## Getting Started\n\n1. **Environment Setup**: The collection uses the `baseUrl` variable. It defaults to Railway production.\n2. **Authentication**: Most endpoints require a Bearer Token.\n    - Use the **Register** or **Login** request in the `Authentication` folder.\n    - The collection automatically saves `token`, `userId`, and `cvId` to variables.\n3. **Workflows**:\n    - **Upload & Parse**: Upload a CV -> Check Parsing Status.\n    - **Optimize**: Get CV Details -> Start Full Optimization -> Check Job Status.\n    - **Generate**: Select Template -> Generate PDF -> Download.\n\n## Support\nFor issues or questions, contact the backend team.",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
		"_exporter_id": "51227799",
		"_collection_link": "https://hythamtag-5630935.postman.co/workspace/f9653f76-3f3d-4702-88ae-6dc1e876ffcc/collection/50602358-110bf408-a4a8-4bf3-8acd-2042d40cb941?action=share&source=collection_link&creator=51227799"
